# Lean — efficient development lifecycle (iPixai)

**Orchestrator rule (slim).** Hard gates + modes stay here.

| Detail lives in | Role |
|-----------------|------|
| `ponytail.mdc` | Smallest safe change ladder |
| `verified-fast-path.mdc` | Canonical solution ladder (native vendor before old iPix/Lumina or custom) |
| `fastest.mdc` | Once per phase: if a faster path exists **without weakening evidence**, **use it** |
| `task-naming.mdc` | **IPI-NNN · TASK-ID — Title** |
| `task-accuracy.mdc` | Evidence / verification levels |
| `ipixai-dev.mdc` | Split-dev, no prod Supabase writes |
| `mastra-mcp.mdc` | Mastra docs MCP (`alwaysApply: false`) |
| `linear-governance.mdc` | Live Linear |
| `linear-task-format.mdc` | IPI issue body → `docs/linear/linear-format.md` |
| `pr-workflow.mdc` | PR + post-merge pointer → skill `post-merge.md` |

**Hard gates (never override):** never force-push to `main`/`master`; one concern per PR **and** per commit; never combined `npm run dev`; never mutate production **by default** (named task + authorization + rollback + dry-run — `verified-fast-path.mdc`); no client AI keys; do not implement from local `/home/sk/ipix` or copy old Mastra wholesale.

## Operating modes

Set explicitly (`lean-strict`, `lean-relaxed`) or default to **lean-standard**.

| Mode | When | Tests | Plan |
|------|------|-------|------|
| **lean-relaxed** | Typo, copy, single-file fix, docs-only | Focused test or lint | Mental checklist OK |
| **lean-standard** | Default feature/fix | Verify touched paths | Short written plan |
| **lean-strict** | Migrations, RLS, auth, Mastra/agents, CopilotKit runtime | Full matrix + build when applicable + honest runtime probes | Plan + rollback notes |

## Decision ladder (reuse → create)

Which solution to use: **`verified-fast-path.mdc`**. Smallest diff after that: **`ponytail.mdc`**.

| Decision | Choose when | Avoid when |
|----------|-------------|------------|
| **Reuse / extend** | Same behavior, clear owner | Hidden coupling / wrong layer |
| **Focused tests** | Every commit during implementation | Full suite on every save |
| **Full suite / build** | Routes, env, middleware, pre-PR | Docs-only change |
| **Open PR** | Branch pushed, checks green | Mixed concerns still in the diff |

## Lifecycle

```text
Understand → Plan → Implement (ponytail) → Test → Diff → Commit → PR
```

Commands (repo root, **not** old `app/`):

- UI: `npm run dev:ui`
- Agent: `npm run dev:agent` (separate terminal)
- Build: `npm run build` (blocked if 3000/4111 busy)

## Checklist (lean-standard+)

```text
[ ] Issue + AC  [ ] Plan  [ ] Smallest safe change
[ ] Verify  [ ] One concern  [ ] Commit → PR
```

## Conflict avoidance

